; A tiny made-up cave for cave-viewer's tests: an entrance, a passage that
; forks, a loop and a pitch. Not a real cave. Build tiny.3d with: cavern tiny.svx
*begin tiny
*title "Tiny Cave"
*cs OSGB:ST
*cs out OSGB:ST
*fix ent 50000 50000 200
*entrance ent
*data normal from to tape compass clino
ent  1   6.0 180 -30
1    2   8.0 170 -5
2    3  10.0 120 0
3    4   7.5 100 -10
4    5   9.0  60 0
5    2  12.0 270 5
2    6   9.0 220 -2
6    7  11.0 200 -60
7    8  14.0 185 -5
8    9  10.0 150 0
*end tiny
